Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the ocean started to disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we took it as a sign that\Nthings might get back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds of that happening anytime soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Jureimon and the Forest of Doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think could\Nhave happened to him, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he was kidnapped by Puppet Mod?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he might have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or something worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, he just walked away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you didn't even try\Nto stop him? Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I thought he was\Njust gonna go use the bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's one thing\Nif he was kidnapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but why would he just\Ndisappear on us like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been gone way too long\Nfor just a potty break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or has Matt\Nbeen kind of strange lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has been acting a little hot-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when Gabumon had\Nthat digivolving problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet there's a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard a voice out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A voice? Was it Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kari, don't you\Nstart losing it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't be very far away, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, it wasn't Matt's voice I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all for exercise, but I'm\Nreally not built for long distances.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, where are we going? Just away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need some space.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the poor little kid\Nneeds a little space.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someplace far away from his nice\Nlittle friends and closer than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put him out of his misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those DigiDestined kids really bug me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Puppetmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take care of those other\NDigiDestined children if you want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as for this one, leave him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have him climbing up a tree\Nbefore I'm through with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ever felt like a fifth wheel, Gabumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time, I thought I\Nhad like a purpose, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To look out for my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought TK wouldn't be able to\Nsurvive without me watching over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But suddenly, it's like he's growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it's not just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's everybody, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:05:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, when I think of Tai and\NMimi and Sora and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this place has changed\Nthem for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like they've\Ndigivolved or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you see, the problem is, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still stuck in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not see it, Matt,\Nbut you've changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, Gabumon, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the same jerk I always was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally got it figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm ever going to change,\NI have to do it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, nature lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you've never seen a talking tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not many.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.36,0:05:56.83,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Jureimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.36,0:05:56.83,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.36,0:05:56.83,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.36,0:05:56.83,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Plant Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.36,0:05:56.83,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.36,0:05:56.83,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cherry Bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Cherrymon, Lord of the Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the best reason for\Nthe existence of termites.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there or I'll\Nturn you into toothpicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't be that rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fighting days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only want to talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you might even say\NI've turned over a new leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.34,0:06:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, the digivices\Naren't working in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm not so sure we\Nshould be trying to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone needs to be alone sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let him break up this team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna find him whether\Nhe wants us to or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're always walking around\Nsearching for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never done so much\Nwalking in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My calves are starting to\Nlook like a bodybuilder's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a what? Oh, Mimi. Yoo-hoo! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppet Mod!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK, did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all, and I'm not going\Nto play with you anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a lot of fun anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Front and center, everybody.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.52,0:07:07.03,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Garbamon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.52,0:07:07.03,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.52,0:07:07.03,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.52,0:07:07.03,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mutant Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.52,0:07:07.03,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.52,0:07:07.03,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Poop Bazooka
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Garbagemon. They're\Nas tough as they are mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they don't smell very good, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dunk Tuckers ready, aim, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's let them do the\Nrunning for a change!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I touched that stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, but even if I felt like\Ntalking, it wouldn't be to a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young man, didn't anyone ever tell\Nyou you should listen to your elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was it Redwood you should listen to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can never quite get those two straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But anyway, I digress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're still stuck in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still the same old jerk you always were.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprised, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be tough being in such a rut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been spying on me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to spy because\Nthere's nothing that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens in this forest\Nthat I don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're so smart, what\Nam I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, simple as that, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids, you want all the answers just\Nhanded to you on a mahogany platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you never want to do\Nthe hard work of looking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deep within yourself where\Nall the answers truly lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you listen to that\Ntalking firewood, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll never learn how to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll always be what you are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, but are you really ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, change isn't\Nalways a pleasant thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might find out a few things\Nthat you wish you hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough talking, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've got some answers, let's see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fell for it like an overripe fig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, kid, I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off, you're going to\Nhave to defeat your rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, in that lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will see the face of\Nthe one who is preventing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you from becoming as\Nstrong as you could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds pretty\Nbogus, but might as well look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't really believe him, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of trick is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that wherever you\Ngo, there will always be garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, ready guys? Make a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An electro shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our full torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting way too spotty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That trash is thrashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you've totally\Nruined my garbage fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beaten, I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psych!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:10:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Juntaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lillymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kijimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trash is nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trash that for too dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That chick is heavier than C-Buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower, get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the face of your rival so you're\Nsaying I have to fight tie is that it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Matt. Yeah, I'd be going\Nthere. We'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lake of truth reflects only what\Nis in a person's heart, hence the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's off this time. Way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can argue with me all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're really only\Narguing with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time you face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one you call Tai is your leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything he says you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everywhere he goes, you follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and yet in your heart you\Nresent it because you know
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're just as qualified\Nto be the boss as he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who died and left you\Nin charge of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just about had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not be ashamed of your\Nresentment. Do not hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Embrace it, for in your\Nanger lies your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only when you recognize that will you\Nat last be free to grow, to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So face your rival and prove you are\Nhis equal, or better, by defeating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's playing games with your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of some kind of trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai is your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my friend, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may not always act like it,\Nbut he's right. Ty's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't fight your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friend? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even believe that such a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really exists! Not in your\Nheart of hearts anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the nail on the head, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loyalty
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comrades
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine-sounding words. But\Nthat's all they are. Words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delusions. And you're wise enough\Nto see that now. You'll know that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:15:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, the only person you can depend\Non is yourself. Isn't that right, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's wrong, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then. That's enough\Nmoping around for now. Look, kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stop staring at your shoes The choice\Nin front of you is simple If you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,truly want to change To reach your\Nfull potential You must defeat Tai
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's either that or be\Ncontent to live your
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life following in the\Nshadows of him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.66,0:15:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you know that my crest\Nhad to be the crest of friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one thing he's right about.\NWhatever you're going to do, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:16:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do what you've got to hear what\Nyour own conscience is telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not listen to anybody else, not\NTai or Cherrymon or me, you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to have faith in yourself matt what\Nif i make the wrong decision i know
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that whatever it is it'll be the\Nright one because i have faith in you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whichever path you take, I'll\Nbe there with you. You mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you do have a friend\Nnever forget that i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always be there matt\Nno matter what Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegiemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, search Vegiemon or the compass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegiemon! Vegiemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scotty, lead the way! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think that went rather well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm surprised by the\Nstrength of the bond between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took every trick I had to undermine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Puppet Mon is in careful,\Nthis game could still be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant what I said, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cherry Mon was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friendship, loyalty, they're\Nmore than just words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're real, and they matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splattering me with their gunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fucking pranks will pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan went perfectly, just\Nas I thought. Plan? What plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I played that trusting sap like a violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna do our dirty\Nwork for us, Puppetmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any second now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll hear the sounds of WarGreymon and\NMetalGarurumon locked in mortal combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're serious? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With any luck, they'll destroy each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the two strongest Digimon out of the\Nway, the rest will fall like rotten fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mortal Kombat, this I've\Ngotta see. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, we gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined are strong,\Nstronger than I suspected,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to underestimate\Nthem could be disastrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I might lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only saying that I think\Nyou should take them seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean, like, something\NI might be missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:18:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have everything I need\Nto take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pop it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that kind of negative\Nattitude really brings me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm being you with!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crash day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody in the can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're lucky, you'll get recycled!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This nasty little creep's really\Nstarting to get on my nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Corry, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corry, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice Wolfclaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGarurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better late than never!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where you been, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving our necks, but\Ndid you have to cut it that close?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to digivolve and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you been eating\Nout there in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is insane Matt what's going on\Nis this some kind of joke Matt I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know what he's doing but call him off\Nnow no time I won't what did you say
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you won't I'm warning you hurry up and\Ndisavolv into war Koromon because I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't miss next time. I think he really\Nmeans it. Well, time's— He's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish I could, but there's only\None person who can stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Matt succeed in destroying\Nthe Digidestined from within?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out next time on\NDigimon Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see my light in my future.
